    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding feels impossible though. how do you rebuild when the very concept of meaning was a lie? it's not just a phase, it feels like the logic of my whole existence just... broke. like there's no reason to even try to find a new floor when i know the ground isn't real.",
